2026-05-09 17:58:10,380 - INFO - - The real question isn't binary: *Should tests be completely eliminated, weighted less, made optional, or redesigned?* matters more than yes/no
2026-05-09 17:58:10,380 - INFO - - Context matters: tests may be more/less useful depending on the college's mission and applicant pool
2026-05-09 17:58:10,380 - INFO - 
