2026-05-09 17:59:11,573 - INFO - - Reduced commuting saves time, money, and environmental impact for workers
2026-05-09 17:59:11,573 - INFO - - Improved work-life balance and flexibility, especially for caregivers
2026-05-09 17:59:11,573 - INFO - - Access to jobs for people with disabilities or mobility constraints
