2026-05-09 17:59:11,574 - INFO - - Some roles genuinely require physical presence
2026-05-09 17:59:11,574 - INFO - - Remote work can increase isolation and blur work-life boundaries for some people
2026-05-09 17:59:11,574 - INFO - - Inequality concerns: remote work advantages flow mainly to office-eligible jobs, while service workers cannot participate
