2026-05-09 18:06:43,723 - INFO - - Its long-term viability is genuinely uncertain
2026-05-09 18:06:43,723 - INFO - - Many people have lost substantial money on it—sometimes through scams, sometimes through volatility
2026-05-09 18:06:43,723 - INFO - 
