2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Print had reliable, recurring revenue (subscriptions + ads) with high margins
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - But circulation has cratered (down ~50% in two decades), and print ad revenue has fallen even faster
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Most print papers now operate at a loss or survive only through wealthy owners subsidizing them
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - 
