2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Digital ads are fragmented, low-CPM, and dominated by Google/Facebook
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Paywalls work only for elite outlets (NYT, WSJ, FT) with brand loyalty or unique value
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Most online news relies on volume play + ad networks, which is precarious
2026-05-09 18:06:50,456 - INFO - - Some bundled subscription models (Apple News+) are emerging but unproven at scale
2026-05-09 18:06:50,457 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:06:50,457 - INFO - **The honest answer:** Both funding models are currently weak. Print is dying but was once sustainable. Online *could* be sustainable (subscription + membership models show promise), but hasn't achieved it at most outlets.
