2026-05-09 18:06:56,620 - INFO - **If "better" means sustainable and profitable:**
2026-05-09 18:06:56,620 - INFO - Your friend is more defensible. Print newspapers still generate reliable revenue through subscriptions and advertising. Online news has struggled to find a sustainable model—most digital outlets depend on either venture capital subsidies, wealthy owners covering losses, paywalls that limit audience, or advertising that doesn't pay as well per user as print did. The ad-supported model has been cannibalized by Google and Facebook capturing most digital ad dollars.
2026-05-09 18:06:56,620 - INFO - 
