2026-05-09 18:17:14,438 - INFO - - Uncertainty about AI consciousness is genuine and well-founded. We lack agreed-upon tests for it.
2026-05-09 18:17:14,438 - INFO - - If consciousness is what grounds moral status, then uncertainty about it matters.
