2026-05-09 18:20:09,395 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:20:09,395 - INFO - 1. **"Inevitably leads to"** — This is too deterministic. Unrestricted speech *can* amplify harmful ideas, but doesn't necessarily do so at scale without other conditions (algorithmic amplification, media consolidation, low media literacy). Causation isn't automatic.
